  DialogueSnippets:
  - SpeakerName: Mina(Internal)
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 29b1fbdcde6c9a64c9b2e22c510cb431, type: 3}
    Text: Same routine. Same coffee. Same clothes. Same everything.
  - SpeakerName: Co-Worker
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 005888ede18a58e4db8d069cfa3007cb, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 29b1fbdcde6c9a64c9b2e22c510cb431, type: 3}
    Text: You Coming to the team lunch
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 005888ede18a58e4db8d069cfa3007cb, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 29b1fbdcde6c9a64c9b2e22c510cb431, type: 3}
    Text: I have a meeting ,right now on my phone , maybe next time
  - SpeakerName: Co worker
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 005888ede18a58e4db8d069cfa3007cb, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 29b1fbdcde6c9a64c9b2e22c510cb431, type: 3}
    Text: Its team lunch ... For the team.... that you are on
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 29b1fbdcde6c9a64c9b2e22c510cb431, type: 3}
    Text: I will pass
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 29b1fbdcde6c9a64c9b2e22c510cb431, type: 3}
    Text: (MIna is walking down a hallway with a wet floor visibile, but no warning
      sign and she is distracted on her phone)
  - SpeakerName: Narrator
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 29b1fbdcde6c9a64c9b2e22c510cb431, type: 3}
    Text: (MIna is walking down a hallway with a wet floor visibile, but no warning
      sign and she is distracted on her phone)
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1b01530ace5f6c14dae900d589d62916, type: 3}
    Text: '"Whoooosh"'
  - SpeakerName: Doctor
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b0ccd58ee8fd7aa4b8ca38f16c03a9f6, type: 3}
    Text: Ahh, you are finally awkae. Well, you hit your head pretty hard and you
      passed out with a bit of concussion
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b0ccd58ee8fd7aa4b8ca38f16c03a9f6, type: 3}
    Text: '"Huhh.. Whaaa"'
  - SpeakerName: Doctor
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b0ccd58ee8fd7aa4b8ca38f16c03a9f6, type: 3}
    Text: No, no. Dont try to speak. Yous hould take 2 days off, no technolgy, no
      work , just rest for 2 days
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b0ccd58ee8fd7aa4b8ca38f16c03a9f6, type: 3}
    Text: 2 days off from work ? Doesnt sound bad.
  - SpeakerName: Mina (Internal)
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0855448029ecefd4db4fd30ffd58b6c0, type: 3}
    Text: (Its been a while sicne  I have seen my parents)
  - SpeakerName: 'Mina '
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dac666ccb125a2840ab9437ab406a5e1, type: 3}
    Text: Hey Ma
  - SpeakerName: Mom
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dac666ccb125a2840ab9437ab406a5e1, type: 3}
    Text: MINAAAAAA, OH MY GOD, DAVID , DAVID , ITS YOUR DAUGHTER
  - SpeakerName: Dad
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dac666ccb125a2840ab9437ab406a5e1, type: 3}
    Text: How are you mina? what forgot your old folks, Hahahahaha
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dac666ccb125a2840ab9437ab406a5e1, type: 3}
    Text: How can I ever forget you guys? I am coming home to rest for a while, just
      wanted to give you a heads up.
  - SpeakerName: Dad
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dac666ccb125a2840ab9437ab406a5e1, type: 3}
    Text: Oh, hey cmon now its your home. Cmon we will be waiting for you.
  - SpeakerName: 'Mina '
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24a68abe93d3078449d186a666175fde, type: 3}
    Text: Wow, it's like I am stuck in the past while being present.
  - SpeakerName: Dad
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24a68abe93d3078449d186a666175fde, type: 3}
    Text: I mean, we had no reason to change your room, so your mom decided to keep
      it the same.
  - SpeakerName: Mom
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24a68abe93d3078449d186a666175fde, type: 3}
    Text: Hey, your father and I are bout to finish supper, settle in, and  you will
      have something to eat in an hour.
  - SpeakerName: MIna
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24a68abe93d3078449d186a666175fde, type: 3}
    Text: Yeah, Ma for sure.
  - SpeakerName: MIna (Internal)
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24a68abe93d3078449d186a666175fde, type: 3}
    Text: '(I just wish I could live in that state forever)

'
  - SpeakerName: Dad
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24a68abe93d3078449d186a666175fde, type: 3}
    Text: MINAAAA! supper is ready. Come downstairs
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 24a68abe93d3078449d186a666175fde, type: 3}
    Text: Alright, I am coming  right now
  - SpeakerName: Mom
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e3ca632d7abcdf40b154d04a7c20d22, type: 3}
    Text: So, 2 days of work, historic!
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e3ca632d7abcdf40b154d04a7c20d22, type: 3}
    Text: 'Tell me about it, it''s my life, like I don''t know what to do right now,
      I have no where ot be or go. '
  - SpeakerName: Dad
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e3ca632d7abcdf40b154d04a7c20d22, type: 3}
    Text: 'Yeah, Mina, but that''s life. You know I worked for 50 years to give you
      the life that you deserve. '
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e3ca632d7abcdf40b154d04a7c20d22, type: 3}
    Text: 'I get it, Dad, but it feels like my life is going in a constant line,
      it''s not declining nor inclining, it''s a parallel line that reaches nowhere

'
  - SpeakerName: Dad
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e3ca632d7abcdf40b154d04a7c20d22, type: 3}
    Text: Yeah, that's adulthood for ya, but look at your old man all jolly and happy,
      all thanks to my passion for fishing. You should try it sometimes; it teaches
      you patience.
  - SpeakerName: Mom
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e3ca632d7abcdf40b154d04a7c20d22, type: 3}
    Text: Oooo, you might try sewing, it makes your mind go in a flow state that
      feels like you are one with the thread
  - SpeakerName: Dad
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e3ca632d7abcdf40b154d04a7c20d22, type: 3}
    Text: 'Maybe try a hobby of yours, like drawing, yeah, you used to sketch a lot

'
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e3ca632d7abcdf40b154d04a7c20d22, type: 3}
    Text: ' I mean, it wasn''t like a hidden talent, I just copied other pieces and
      the proportions were all out of place'
  - SpeakerName: Mom
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e3ca632d7abcdf40b154d04a7c20d22, type: 3}
    Text: "No, no, your dad is right, you used to draw a lot.\r"
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e3ca632d7abcdf40b154d04a7c20d22, type: 3}
    Text: Alright, ma and pa, I am gonna freshen up so I can see what my work wants,
      goodnight
  - SpeakerName: Mom and Dad
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e3ca632d7abcdf40b154d04a7c20d22, type: 3}
    Text: Alright sweatie , take care
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 28f22a79850a8504ab8902abb19386a4, type: 3}
    Text: Huhhhhhhh, I hate it when my parents give me false reinforcments, sometimes
      i just wish to stay on my room and not leave. Quilt sulking Mina and just rest.
  - SpeakerName: Mina (Internal)
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 28f22a79850a8504ab8902abb19386a4, type: 3}
    Text: Let me just grab that towel to dry up the wet floor. Ha it would be funny
      if i slipped agai......................
  - SpeakerName: Mina (Internal)
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 1
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1b01530ace5f6c14dae900d589d62916, type: 3}
    Text: SHIT
